  "details": "A mirror mask setting that respects your avatar culling options (and disabled avatars) would be lovely. This would mean that the diamonds would be completely culled from the mirror and it would only show shown avis, and fallbacks. \n\nThis would be a perfect pairing to an update for a friends only mirror, which has been suggested by a few people already. \n\nBoth of these additional masking options would be very helpful in tight and busy worlds like clubs and popular public worlds where there may be a group of people standing behind you that you don’t necessarily want in your mirror, but you may want the person next to you or your friends in the mirror.",
